sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    actor Creator
    participant SF as Student Frontend
    participant CF as Creator Frontend
    participant API as Django REST API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Email as Email Service
    participant Queue as Message Broker
    participant Worker as Celery Worker

    Student->>SF: Переглядає каталог курсів
    SF->>API: GET /api/courses/
    API->>DB: SELECT courses (published=true)
    DB-->>API: courses[]
    API-->>SF: courses[]
    SF-->>Student: Список курсів
    
    Student->>SF: Натискає "Подати заявку"
    SF->>API: POST /api/applications/
    Note over SF,API: {course_id, student_id}
    
    API->>DB: INSERT application(status=pending)
    DB-->>API: application_id
    API-->>SF: 201 Created {application_id}
    SF-->>Student: ✓ Заявку надіслано
    
    API->>Queue: Задача: notify_creator(application_id)
    Queue->>Worker: Викликати notify_creator()
    Worker->>DB: SELECT creator_email, student_name
    Worker->>Email: Надіслати email creator
    Email-->>Worker: Email sent
    
    Note over Creator: Отримує email про нову заявку
    
    Creator->>CF: Відкриває "Заявки"
    CF->>API: GET /api/applications/?status=pending
    API->>DB: SELECT applications
    DB-->>API: applications[]
    API-->>CF: applications[]
    CF-->>Creator: Список заявок
    
    alt Creator приймає заявку
        Creator->>CF: "Прийняти"
        CF->>API: PATCH /api/applications/{id}/
        Note over CF,API: {status: "accepted"}
        
        API->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        API->>DB: UPDATE application (status=accepted)
        API->>DB: INSERT student_courses(student, course)
        API->>DB: COMMIT
        DB-->>API: Success
        
        API->>Queue: Задача: notify_student_accepted()
        Queue->>Worker: Викликати notify_student_accepted()
        Worker->>Email: Надіслати email student
        Email-->>Worker: Email sent
        
        API-->>CF: 200 OK
        CF-->>Creator: ✓ Заявку прийнято
        
        Note over SF: Student отримує push notification
        SF->>API: WebSocket: application_accepted
        SF-->>Student: 🎉 Вас додано до курсу!
        
    else Creator відхиляє заявку
        Creator->>CF: "Відхилити"
        CF->>API: PATCH /api/applications/{id}/
        Note over CF,API: {status: "rejected"}
        
        API->>DB: UPDATE application (status=rejected)
        DB-->>API: Success
        
        API->>Queue: Задача: notify_student_rejected()
        Queue->>Worker: Викликати notify_student_rejected()
        Worker->>Email: Надіслати email student
        
        API-->>CF: 200 OK
        CF-->>Creator: Заявку відхилено
        
        SF->>API: WebSocket: application_rejected
        SF-->>Student: Заявку відхилено
    end